{"ed318": {"type": "FeatureCollection", "metadata": {"provider": [{"lang": "en-GB", "text": "Transportstyrelsen"}], "issued": "2026-08-13T00:00:00Z", "validFrom": "2026-08-13T00:00:00Z"}, "features": [{"type": "Feature", "geometry": {"type": "Point", "coordinates": [20.051111111111112, 63.852222222222224], "layer": {"upper": 150, "upperReference": "AGL", "lower": 0, "lowerReference": "AGL", "uom": "m"}, "extent": {"subType": "Circle", "radius": 500.0}}, "properties": {"identifier": "ESU200", "country": "SWE", "name": [{"text": "Stornorrforsen hydro power plant", "lang": "en-GB"}, {"text": "Stornorrforsen kraftverk", "lang": "se-SE"}], "variant": "COMMON", "reason": ["SENSITIVE"], "type": "REQ_AUTHORIZATION", "zoneAuthority": [{"name": [{"text": "Swedish Transport Agency", "lang": "en-GB"}, {"text": "Transportstyrelsen", "lang": "se-SE"}], "purpose": "AUTHORIZATION", "intervalBefore": "P14DT00H00M", "phone": [{"text": "+46771503503", "lang": "se-SE"}], "contactName": [{"text": "Transportstyrelsen", "lang": "se-SE"}], "siteURL": [{"text": "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/luftfart/flygplatser-flygtrafiktjanst-och-luftrum/luftrum/geografiska-uas-zoner/", "lang": "se-SE"}], "email": [{"text": "luftfart@transportstyrelsen.se", "lang": "se-SE"}]}, {"name": [{"text": "Vattenfall", "lang": "en-GB"}, {"text": "Vattenfall", "lang": "se-SE"}], "purpose": "NOTIFICATION", "intervalBefore": "P07DT00H00M", "contactName": [{"text": "Vattenfall Vattenkraft AB", "lang": "se-SE"}], "service": [{"text": "Assessment", "lang": "se-SE"}], "email": [{"text": "bevakningscentral.vattenkraft@vattenfall.se", "lang": "se-SE"}]}], "restrictionConditions": "AUTHORIZED", "otherReasonInfo": [{"text": "Security", "lang": "en-GB"}, {"text": "Säkerhet", "lang": "se-SE"}], "regulationExemption": "NO", "message": [{"text": "Access prohibited. Special permission from the Swedish Transport Agency is required, except for activities conducted by the Swedish Armed Forces, the Swedish Customs Service or the Police Authority, air rescue services, firefighting, border control and coast guard operations carried out by other Swedish authorities, activities undertaken pursuant to the Civil Protection Act (2003:778), as well as UAS operations conducted by Vattenfall Vattenkraft AB. \nNon-exempt actors must first obtain an assessment from Vattenfall (bevakningscentral.vattenkraft@vattenfall.com) before applying for permission from the Swedish Transport Agency. More information is available at https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/luftfart/flygplatser-flygtrafiktjanst-och-luftrum/luftrum/ansok-i-luftrumsarenden/ansokan-om-att-flyga-i-geografiska-uas-zoner/. ", "lang": "en-GB"}, {"text": "Tillträde förbjudet. Särskilda tillstånd från Transportstyrelsen krävs utom för verksamhet som utövas av Försvarsmakten, Tullverket eller Polismyndigheten, flygräddning, brandbekämpning, gränskontroll och kustbevakning som utförs av andra svenska myndigheter, verksamhet som utövas enligt lag (2003:778) om skydd mot olyckor samt UAS-verksamhet som utförs av Vattenfall Vattenkraft AB. \nEj undantagna aktörer ska först inhämta ett utlåtande från Vattenfall (bevakningscentral.vattenkraft@vattenfall.com) innan tillstånd söks hos Transportstyrelsen, mer info på https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/luftfart/flygplatser-flygtrafiktjanst-och-luftrum/luftrum/ansok-i-luftrumsarenden/ansokan-om-att-flyga-i-geografiska-uas-zoner/.", "lang": "se-SE"}], "extendedProperties": {"text": "SE: Undantagna aktörer ska, så snart omständigheterna medger, underrätta Vattenfall Vattenkraft AB om att UAS-verksamhet kommer att bedrivas inom berörd zon, genom meddelande till bevakningscentral.vattenkraft@vattenfall.com. I brådskande fall får verksamheten påbörjas innan underrättelse har skett. EN: Exempted operators shall, as soon as circumstances allow, notify Vattenfall Vattenkraft AB of UAS operations within the relevant zone by sending a message to bevakningscentral.vattenkraft@vattenfall.com. In urgent cases, operations may commence prior to such notification."}, "limitedApplicability": [{"startDateTime": "2025-10-27T00:00Z"}]}}, {"type": "Feature", "geometry": {"type": "Polygon", "coordinates": [[[20.948611111111113, 64.74583333333334], [20.768611111111106, 64.74027777777778], [20.695, 64.70388888888894], [20.755277777777778, 64.685], [20.973055555555558, 64.71083333333331], [20.966666666666665, 64.72972222222222], [20.948611111111113, 64.74583333333334]]], "layer": {"upper": 150, "upperReference": "AGL", "lower": 0, "lowerReference": "AGL", "uom": "m"}}, "properties": {"identifier": "ESU208", "country": "SWE", "name": [{"text": "Skellefteå Drone Port", "lang": "en-GB"}, {"text": "Skellefteå Drone Port", "lang": "se-SE"}], "variant": "COMMON", "reason": ["OTHER"], "type": "CONDITIONAL", "zoneAuthority": [{"name": [{"text": "Swedish Transport Agency", "lang": "en-GB"}, {"text": "Transportstyrelsen", "lang": "se-SE"}], "purpose": "INFORMATION", "intervalBefore": "P01DT00H00M", "phone": [{"text": "+46771503503", "lang": "se-SE"}], "contactName": [{"text": "Transportstyrelsen", "lang": "se-SE"}], "siteURL": [{"text": "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/luftfart/flygplatser-flygtrafiktjanst-och-luftrum/luftrum/geografiska-uas-zoner/", "lang": "se-SE"}], "email": [{"text": "luftfart@transportstyrelsen.se", "lang": "se-SE"}]}, {"name": [{"text": "Skellefteå City Airport", "lang": "en-GB"}, {"text": "Skellefteå City Airport", "lang": "se-SE"}], "purpose": "NOTIFICATION", "intervalBefore": "P01DT00H00M", "phone": [{"text": "+4691057625", "lang": "se-SE"}], "contactName": [{"text": "Skellefteå City Airport", "lang": "se-SE"}], "service": [{"text": "Consultation", "lang": "se-SE"}], "siteURL": [{"text": "https://skellefteaairport.se/om-flygplatsen/#flyga-dronare", "lang": "se-SE"}], "email": [{"text": "info@sft.se", "lang": "se-SE"}]}], "restrictionConditions": "AUTHORIZED", "otherReasonInfo": [{"text": "Test site", "lang": "en-GB"}, {"text": "Testanläggning", "lang": "se-SE"}], "reg